flowchart LR
  subgraph Current[Retained M4/BaseFold: disqualified]
    M[message] --> RSm[RS message]
    R[random mask] --> RSr[RS mask]
    RSm --> L[opened leaf: message coordinate and mask coordinate]
    RSr --> L
    L --> Leak[project first lane: witness-dependent value]
  end

  subgraph Required[Theorem-valid replacement]
    M2[message] --> Join[randomized message: m plus fresh coefficients]
    R2[fresh coefficients] --> Join
    Join --> Enc[single randomized codeword]
    Enc --> Share[open only simulator-samplable shares]
    Share --> Fold[masked sumcheck, private OOD, code switch]
    Fold --> Base[masked terminal case]
  end

  Leak -. cannot be repaired by wider field .-> Required

